\ Companion module for import_field_fidelity.1z.
\
\ Defines a documented word, a parse-time-only word, a bracket-less binding, a parse-time word,
\ and a user marker, so the driver can check that each property survives a `use` import.

\\ A word whose doc comment must survive a `use` import.
documented-word: [ 42 ] ;

\\ A parse-time-only word, to check that the restriction survives a `use` import.
pt-only-word: parse-time-only [ 42 ] ;

\\ A bracket-less binding, to check that it is still a binding after a `use` import.
bound-value: 7 ;

\\ A parse-time word, to check that it is still parse-time after a `use` import.
parse-time-word: parse-time [ ] ;

\\ A user marker, which is both a bracket-less binding and parse-time.
helper-mark: make-marker ;
